  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The tangent to <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>y</mi></math> is <math><mi>k</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><msup><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br />Normal to <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi></math> is <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>m</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math> ( <math><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> is rejected)<br />Hence, the difference of slopes is equal to <math><mn>1</mn></math>",
